#: properties/edge_style_properties.py:270
msgid "Draw an edge more transparently the more of the graph shares its route, so a dense bundle stops reading as one opaque mass. 0 keeps every edge at the opacity its color asks for"
msgstr "共享路线的图范围越大，边绘制得越透明，使密集束不再看起来像一整块不透明体。0 时每条边保持其颜色所需的透明度"

#: ui/gpu_render/properties.py:320
msgid "Draw circular points instead of squares (uses a custom shader when supported)"
msgstr "绘制圆点而非方点（支持时使用自定义着色器）"

#: ui/gpu_render/properties.py:894
msgid "Draw graph edges"
msgstr "绘制图边"

#: ui/tools.py:645
msgid "Draw lasso around nodes to select"
msgstr "围绕节点绘制套索以选择"

#: properties/edge_style_properties.py:174
msgid "Draw long curves more transparently than short ones, so long-range links stop painting over the local structure they fly past. 0 keeps every edge at the same opacity"
msgstr "长曲线比短曲线绘制得更透明，使远距离连边不再覆盖它们掠过的局部结构。0 时每条边保持相同透明度"

#: ui/gpu_render/properties.py:966
msgid "Draw node labels directly in the render engine (viewport and F12), using the Text Labels settings from the SciGraphs panel. No compositor texture is involved; labels stay sharp over depth of field and are occlusion-tested against the depth buffer"
msgstr "直接在渲染引擎中绘制节点标签（视图和 F12），使用 SciGraphs 面板中的文本标签设置。不涉及合成器纹理；标签在景深下保持清晰，并针对深度缓冲进行遮挡测试"

#: ui/gpu_render/properties.py:144
msgid "Draw nodes/edges directly on the GPU. Fast, interactive, ideal for exploring large graphs. Not shown in Cycles/EEVEE renders"
msgstr "直接在 GPU 上绘制节点/边。快速、可交互，适合探索大图。不会显示在 Cycles/EEVEE 渲染中"

#: ui/gpu_render/properties.py:155
msgid "Draw the active graph as fast GPU points and lines"
msgstr "以快速 GPU 点和线绘制活动图"

#: ui/gpu_render/properties.py:440
msgid "Draw the cloud at every distance, over the nodes"
msgstr "在任意距离绘制云，覆盖在节点之上"

#: ui/gpu_render/properties.py:1002
msgid "Draw the colormap's scale into the image. A figure whose colors carry a value and whose scale is missing cannot be read, and the key names the normalization too, since a log ramp with linear ticks is a lie"
msgstr "将颜色映射的刻度绘制到图像中。颜色承载数值却缺少刻度的图无法解读，图例还会标明归一化方式，因为带线性刻度的对数渐变是误导"

#: ui/gpu_render/properties.py:404
msgid "Draw the density cloud. The field itself is chosen below"
msgstr "绘制密度云。场本身在下方选择"

#: ui/gpu_render/properties.py:442
msgid "Draw the field and nothing else: no node is drawn individually, at any distance"
msgstr "只绘制场，不绘制其他内容：任意距离都不单独绘制节点"

#: ui/gpu_render/properties.py:497
msgid "Draw the field as this many nested density shells instead of a cloud, at evenly spaced fractions of the peak density. A cloud shows where the density is high; shells put it on a scale you can count, and give the outer haze a definite surface. 0 draws the cloud. Costs nothing to change: it is a draw-time uniform"
msgstr "以这么多层嵌套密度壳代替云绘制场，壳位于峰值密度的等间隔比例处。云显示密度高的位置；壳将其置于可计数的刻度上，并给外围雾霭一个明确的表面。0 绘制云。更改为零成本：它是绘制时统一变量"

#: ui/gpu_render/properties.py:409
msgid "Draw the nodes as a volumetric density field instead of (or as well as) individual elements. The field is built once in world space, so its brightness is a real density and the draw cost no longer depends on how many nodes there are"
msgstr "将节点绘制为体积密度场，代替（或同时配合）单个元素。场在世界空间中只构建一次，因此其亮度是真实密度，绘制开销不再取决于节点数量"

#: ui/gpu_render/properties.py:223
msgid "Draw the spatial structure the running simulation reads its repulsion off. It is a uniform grid, not a tree: the cell count is fixed, so the nodes per cell grow with the graph, and seeing which cell has swallowed the layout is the point"
msgstr "绘制运行中的模拟读取其斥力所依据的空间结构。它是均匀网格而非树：单元数量固定，因此每个单元的节点数随图增长，看清哪个单元吞掉了布局才是重点"

