msgstr "有向边箭头的绘制方式"

#: ui/gpu_render/properties.py:731
msgid "How edge magnitudes are mapped onto thickness"
msgstr "边的大小如何映射到粗细"

#: ui/gpu_render/properties.py:336
msgid "How edges are drawn. Auto picks by on-screen thickness (LOD)"
msgstr "边的绘制方式。自动按屏幕上的粗细选择（LOD）"

#: properties/scene_properties.py:388
msgid "How edges are rendered in geospatial mode"
msgstr "地理空间模式下边的渲染方式"

#: properties/edge_style_properties.py:299
msgid "How far an edge looks for company, as a fraction of the graph's diagonal. This is what replaces the all-pairs matrix: the attraction falls off with distance anyway, so cutting it off at a radius costs accuracy that is bounded and buys the edge count"
msgstr "边在多远范围内寻找同伴，以图的对角线比例表示。这替代了全对矩阵：吸引力本就随距离衰减，因此在某个半径处截断只会损失有界精度，却换来边数控制"

#: ui/gpu_render/properties.py:250
msgid "How far down the quadtree the overlay draws. Graphviz splits until a leaf holds one point, so the deepest cells are far under a pixel and the whole thing reads as a flat mesh; stopping earlier is what makes the nesting visible. Does not change the forces"
msgstr "叠加层绘制到四叉树的哪一层。Graphviz 会一直细分到叶子只含一个点，因此最深层单元远小于一个像素，整体看起来像平面网格；提前停止才能让嵌套可见。不改变力"

#: ui/gpu_render/toon/properties.py:71
msgid "How far each band edge is feathered. A little is not a stylistic choice: a hard step aliases badly on a curved impostor"
msgstr "每个色带边缘的羽化程度。少量羽化并非风格选择：硬阶跃在曲面 impostor 上会产生严重锯齿"

#: properties/layout_properties.py:85
msgid "How far every node moves on the first iteration, as a fraction of the optimal distance. Yifan Hu moves each node the same distance along its own force, so this is the whole step and only it cools"
msgstr "首次迭代时每个节点移动的距离，以最优距离的比例表示。Yifan Hu 算法让每个节点沿自身受力方向移动相同距离，因此这就是完整步长，且只有它会冷却"

#: properties/edge_style_properties.py:436
msgid "How far toward its skeleton point an edge moves each round"
msgstr "每轮边向其骨架点移动的距离"

#: ui/gpu_render/properties.py:140
msgid "How graphs are shown in the viewport"
msgstr "图在视图中的显示方式"

#: ui/gpu_render/toon/properties.py:66
msgid "How many brightness bands the light is quantized into"
msgstr "光照被量化为多少个亮度色带"

#: ui/gpu_render/properties.py:304
msgid "How many frames of the layout to record. Within it the trajectory is kept in memory, so a scrub or a second play shows exactly what was watched. Past it the simulation keeps running but nothing is stored, so those frames neither scrub nor render the same way twice"
msgstr "记录布局多少帧。在此范围内轨迹保留在内存中，因此拖动时间轴或再次播放会显示与观看时完全一致的内容。超出后模拟继续运行但不存储，这些帧既不能拖动查看，也无法每次渲染一致"

#: properties/edge_style_properties.py:410
msgid "How many groups the edges are split into before each group is drawn and skeletonised. Too few and unrelated edges share a skeleton; too many and nothing bundles"
msgstr "边在逐组绘制和骨架化前被分成多少组。太少会让无关边共用骨架；太多则无法形成捆绑"

#: properties/edge_style_properties.py:346
msgid "How many nearby edges each one is offered as merge partners. More does not reliably mean tighter: measured, the ink saved is flat to slightly worse above about ten, because taking the largest saving first is not the best set of merges and one big merge can block two that were worth more together"
msgstr "每条边有多少邻近边可作为合并候选。更多并不一定更紧：实测超过约十个后，节省的墨迹基本持平甚至略差，因为优先取最大节省并非最佳合并集合，而且一次大合并可能挡住两次合起来更值的合并"

#: properties/edge_style_properties.py:480
msgid "How many times every edge is re-routed. Each round makes the stretches already in use cheaper, which is what pulls separate paths onto a shared road"
msgstr "每条边被重新路由多少次。每轮都会让已使用的路段更便宜，从而把分离路径拉到共享道路上"

#: properties/edge_style_properties.py:361
msgid "How many times the merged bundles are themselves offered for merging. The recursion stops on its own when no merge saves any ink, so raising this past that point costs nothing"
msgstr "合并后的捆绑再作为合并候选多少次。当没有合并能节省墨迹时递归会自行停止，因此超过该点再提高不会带来额外开销"

#: ui/gpu_render/properties.py:518
msgid "How many view-aligned slices integrate the field per frame. More is smoother and costs linearly more fill; too few shows as banding across the cloud"
msgstr "每帧用多少个视图对齐切片积分场。更多更平滑，填充开销线性增加；太少会在云上显示为条带"

#: properties/edge_style_properties.py:493
msgid "How much cheaper a stretch of grid becomes for having been used. 0 leaves every round independent and nothing converges"
msgstr "一段网格因被使用而便宜多少。0 会让每轮相互独立，无法收敛"

#: properties/edge_style_properties.py:423
msgid "How much drawn density a pixel needs before it counts as inside the shape the skeleton is taken from"
msgstr "像素需要多少绘制密度才算位于提取骨架的形状内部"

#: ui/gpu_render/properties.py:656
msgid "How much of a community a merge may newly hide, as a fraction of its members, before the merge is refused and it is drawn out again. This is the trade: near zero draws almost every node, near one merges almost everything"
msgstr "一次合并最多可新隐藏一个社区的多少比例成员，超过则拒绝该合并并重新展开绘制。这是权衡：接近零会绘制几乎所有节点，接近一则合并几乎所有内容"

#: ui/gpu_render/toon/properties.py:85
msgid "How much of the impostor the stepped highlight covers"
msgstr "阶梯式高光覆盖 impostor 的比例"

#: ui/gpu_render/toon/properties.py:181
msgid "How much the glyph is inflated out of its plane. 1 is full spherical relief (a round glyph is then exactly the sphere impostor), 0 is a flat plate facing the camera"
msgstr "字形从其平面鼓出多少。1 为完整球面浮雕（此时圆形字形正好是球面 impostor），0 为朝向相机的平板"

#: ui/gpu_render/properties.py:814
msgid "How node colors are chosen"
msgstr "节点颜色的选择方式"

#: ui/gpu_render/toon/properties.py:56
msgid "How nodes and edges are shaded. Everything but Lit is a non-photorealistic model evaluated in the same impostor, so switching costs a redraw and never a rebuild"
msgstr "节点和边的着色方式。除 Lit 外都是在同一 impostor 中求值的非真实感模型，因此切换只需重绘，从不需要重建"

#: ui/gpu_render/properties.py:325
msgid "How nodes are drawn. Auto picks by on-screen size (LOD)"
msgstr "节点的绘制方式。自动按屏幕上的大小选择（LOD）"

#: ui/gpu_render/properties.py:487
msgid "How opaque a full traverse of the densest part of the cloud is. Defined against the whole grid rather than per voxel, so changing the resolution changes the detail and not the look. Costs nothing to change: it is a draw-time uniform, so nothing is rebuilt"
msgstr "完整穿过云最密集部分时的最大不透明度。它是相对于整个网格定义的，而非逐体素，因此改变分辨率只改变细节而不改变外观。更改无开销：它是绘制时 uniform，不会重建任何内容"

#: ui/gpu_render/properties.py:765
msgid "How strong the taper is. 0 leaves both ends equal, 1 makes the narrow end as thin as it goes"
msgstr "锥化的强度。0 使两端相等，1 使窄端细到极限"

