#: ui/gpu_render/operators.py:254
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Write the current vertex selection as the seed set, so Hops From Seed measures distance to it. Stored as a mesh attribute rather than read from the selection every frame, which is what makes an ego network survive saving the file -- and what keeps the seed still while the selection moves"
msgstr "将当前顶点选择写入为种子集，使「从种子出发的跳数」以它为距离基准。种子集存储为网格属性，而不是每帧从选择中读取，因此自我网络在保存文件后仍能保留——并且当选择移动时种子保持不变"
